#Semantic_Map_Backlog_Cross_Highlight_V1<[
Базис:
  Architecture map и dependency graph — derived projections; backlog UI должен cross-highlight related tasks при focus.
Вектор:
  Mapping: workId -> architectureBlockId (classifyWorkItemBlock) + intent domain + targetFiles.
  Focus behavior: click task card highlights graph node и architecture block peers; graph click opens task drawer.
  Graph остаётся read-only derived view без второго source of truth.
Цель:
  Semantic navigation связывает kanban, architecture и dependencies.

Метки:
